{"availability":"available","full":"ajisth69/clashgram","name":"clashgram","description":"Clashgram Web is an open-source, glassmorphic client with animated themes, emoji spoofing, live translation, a native voice changer, local AI voice-to-text, web calling, and an Experimental Suite for advanced protocol/caching control. https://t.me/clashprojects","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":110,"forks":13,"created":"2026-05-24T09:36:39Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:43:38Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://clashgram.pages.dev/","topics":["android","anti-delete","capacitor","ghost-mode","glassmorphism","privacy","telegram","telegram-client","whisper-ai"],"demo":"https://clashgram.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:08.533Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:08.533Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:08.533Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:58:08.533Z","stars":110,"forks":13}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Privacy-hardened client modification of the Telegram Web client.","Clashgram is an open-source client for Telegram designed to block telemetry, retain deleted/edited messages locally, and support hybrid server/local audio transcription."],"features":["Typing Indicator: Intercepts and discards outgoing typing/activity signals.","Presence status: Discards outgoing status updates (account.updateStatus), keeping the account status offline.","Anti-Delete: Retains messages locally in IndexedDB after a remote deletion request (UpdateDeleteMessages).","Anti-Edit: Preserves the original message text upon remote edits (UpdateEditMessage) and renders it as metadata.","Storage Pruner: Cleans up local messages automatically after 1, 3, or 7 days."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ajisth69/clashgram/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"10f275c68f7d234c9c72dbd68032196e54ea467d56a0739ccfeb2675fc88c63a","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:08.668Z"},"overvi